      "section_id": "afe2b95b",
      "title": "Neural Operators",
      "text": "Traditional neural networks learn mappings between finite-dimensional vectors. In contrast, many scientific problems require learning mappings between functions, known as operators . Neural operators enable direct learning of these function-to-function mappings.",
